{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54694","headline":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 三十二 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 三十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太阳畔，如幕（京本作「蔓」）又如花。\n相继相连不间（京本作「黏不」）断，嫔妃皇后乱其家，术士见生涯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54694.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54694","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}